abstract: 'Site-neutral EasyBuild pipeline driver: one per-site TOML file turns
  a build list and a target into ordered eb-stack, eb-keep-logs, eb-staged-rebuild
  and eb subprocesses, with a result file and exit-code contract for CI.'
